om/users/tcitworld/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tcitworld/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tcitworld/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tcitworld/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tcitworld/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tcitworld/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"MDc6UmVsZWFzZTMwNDIwMDUy","tag_name":"2.4.0","target_commitish":"master","name":"Version 2.4.0","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2020-08-31T06:39:37Z","updated_at":"2020-08-31T07:05:29Z","published_at":"2020-08-31T07:05:29Z","assets":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wallabag/android-app/releases/assets/24539881","id":24539881,"node_id":"MDEyOlJlbGVhc2VBc3NldDI0NTM5ODgx","name":"wallabag-2.4.0.apk","label":null,"uploader":{"login":"tcitworld","id":2197836,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTc4MzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2197836?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tcitworld","html_url":"https://github.com/tcitworld","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tcitworld/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tcitworld/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tcitworld/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tcitworld/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tcitworld/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tcitworld/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tcitworld/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tcitworld/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tcitworld/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/vnd.android.package-archive","state":"uploaded","size":9797836,"digest":null,"download_count":68,"created_at":"2020-08-31T07:00:16Z","updated_at":"2020-08-31T07:05:29Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/wallabag/android-app/releases/download/2.4.0/wallabag-2.4.0.apk"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wallabag/android-app/tarball/2.4.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wallabag/android-app/zipball/2.4.0","body":"# Added\r\n\r\n* @di72nn made the articles content use lazy-load, which improves performance a bit. This also brings full-text search and [advanced queries](https://www.sqlite.org/fts3.html#full_text_index_queries). **A full sync is recommended** https://github.com/wallabag/android-app/pull/874 https://github.com/wallabag/android-app/pull/872\r\n* @di72nn added experimental support for annotations. This feature is disabled by default until we polish the angles and can be activated in the settings. https://github.com/wallabag/android-app/pull/843\r\n* @di72nn added the possibility to launch a QR code scanner app for easier wallabag credentials setup https://github.com/wallabag/android-app/pull/369\r\n* @di72nn added extra stacktrace details when an error happens and also added a button on the error notification to copy the details to the clipboard https://github.com/wallabag/android-app/pull/881\r\n* @di72nn added two new actions in the settings to help fix queue/synchronization issues : the ability to dump the queue to a local file and the possibility to remove the first queue item found. https://github.com/wallabag/android-app/pull/915\r\n* @The-Compiler introduced an option to inspect chromium webviews to assist debugging https://github.com/wallabag/android-app/pull/884\r\n* Share-menu: favorite/archive/tag articles right after sharing.\r\n* Tags (clickable) are displayed in the article view.\r\n* \"Untagged\" list.\r\n* Long-press menu (only for single articles).\r\n* Saving origin URL when adding from other articles.\r\n* Splash screen when starting app https://github.com/wallabag/android-app/pull/1008\r\n\r\n# Changed\r\n\r\n* @di72nn updated their wallabag API wrapper library to the latest version, which brings a few optimizations and compatibility with latest wallabag versions https://github.com/wallabag/android-app/pull/861\r\n* @The-Compiler made the Onxy e-ink devices use the specific e-ink theme https://github.com/wallabag/android-app/pull/886\r\n* @di72nn added a Gradle Wrapper Validation Github Action to prevent bad gradle-wrapper.jar binaries\r\n* Dependencies updates\r\n* Text-to-speech changes\r\n  - Better interruption handling.\r\n  - Image alt-text is now pronounced.\r\n  - Some other changes.\r\n* Limit the number of suggested tags to 50.\r\n* Startup time improvements.\r\n\r\n# Fixed\r\n\r\n* @di72nn fixed issues with themes in fullscreen view and action bar when watching full screen videos https://github.com/wallabag/android-app/pull/870\r\n* @di72nn fixed a webview crash happening with Android 5 https://github.com/wallabag/android-app/pull/877\r\n* thanks to @Strubbl and @di72nn, the special characters in the title are now HTML decoded https://github.com/wallabag/android-app/pull/893\r\n* @di72nn fixed a sync error when deleting all tags from an article\r\n* Adaptive icon.\r\n* UI should no longer be blocked by database operations.\r\n* Other fixes and improvements\r\n* Various fixes #1004 #1005 #1006 #1011\r\n* Fixed crash on the tags management screen. ([@di72nn](https://github.com/wallabag/android-app/pull/1027))\r\n* Fixed annotations. ([@di72nn](https://github.com/wallabag/android-app/pull/1028))\r\n\r\n\r\n# Updated translations\r\n* Basque\r\n* Chinese (Simplified)\r\n* Croatian\r\n* Dutch\r\n* French\r\n* German\r\n* Hungarian\r\n* Italian\r\n* Japanese\r\n* Korean\r\n* Norwegian Bokmål\r\n* Polish\r\n* Russian\r\n* Spanish\r\n* Turkish\r\n* Ukrainian\r\n\r\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wallabag/android-app/releases/29687168","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wallabag/android-app/releases/29687168/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.git